 "name_en": "Specification Management for Recipes (1QA)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Specification Management for Recipes (1QA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio70c4692f31534d628f0b3ab1e70f7806\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio70c4692f31534d628f0b3ab1e70f7806__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Within the recipe development functionality, specification management provides you with a Web UI to manage ingredients and output substances of a recipe. Simplified data maintenance also supports occasional users. The maintenance functionality covers the management of attributes (physical, chemical, compositional, regulatory, and nutritional properties) needed by a recipe developer.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio70c4692f31534d628f0b3ab1e70f7806__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create qualitative attributes (such as allergens)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create nutrients</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create pure substances</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create raw substance</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio70c4692f31534d628f0b3ab1e70f7806__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Balance software requirements and user needs with a new, user-focused UI</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use a tool set designed for product development use cases</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>配方的规格管理 (1QA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio70c4692f31534d628f0b3ab1e70f7806\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio70c4692f31534d628f0b3ab1e70f7806__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在配方开发功能中，规格管理为您提供 Web UI 来管理配方的成分和输出物质。简化的数据维护还支持临时用户。维护功能包括管理配方开发人员所需的属性（物理、化学、成分、监管和营养特性）。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio70c4692f31534d628f0b3ab1e70f7806__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建定性属性（例如过敏原）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建营养成分</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建纯物质</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建原始物质</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio70c4692f31534d628f0b3ab1e70f7806__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">借助以用户为中心的新用户界面，平衡软件要求和用户需求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用专为产品开发用例设计的工具集。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
